id.instance: String (TS "c<n>") (not used in this chunk)
num.game: i32 (ladder positions, pips, games, wins; durations and epoch ms i64, caps usize, ratings f64)
num.cursor: u32 (not used in this chunk)
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value> (not used in this chunk)
error.style: Result<_, EnvError> with TS's message (load_env); Result<_, ApiError> with TS's code and message (handlers); panic only on invariants (season_id_of, TS threw)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators (not used in this chunk)
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back (not used in this chunk)
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box (the tests' GoTrue scripts and the provider's now seam are Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> too)
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state (not used in this chunk)
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only (event = "<TS event name>", TS's camelCase keys as quoted field names)
env.fields: TS's SCREAMING names snake_cased and lower-cased (supabase_url, e2e, catalog_version, trusted_proxy_hops, deployed_commit)
clock.server: crate::app::now_ms() (epoch ms, moved by tokio's paused clock); tests that move it run start_paused
